<!--
    Font declarations for Gundam Base Portable.

    HOW TO ADD YOUR FONTS:
    1. Download from Google Fonts:
       • Orbitron Bold  → https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Orbitron
       • Exo 2 Regular  → https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Exo+2
    2. Place .ttf files in:
         app/src/main/res/font/
       with these exact filenames:
         orbitron_bold.ttf
         exo2_regular.ttf
         exo2_semibold.ttf   (optional, for headings)

    Until you add real files, the app will fall back to the system default sans-serif font.
-->
